@startuml
!include _sequence-bce-style.puml

title UC-0037: Auditoria Blockchain (Analisis BCE)

actor Actor
boundary "PanelAuditoria" as PA
control "GestorAuditoria" as CA
entity "Transaccion" as ET

database "Base de datos" as DB
boundary "Blockchain" as BC

Actor -> PA : 1. Introduce hash de transaccion o documento
PA -> CA : 2. Envia hash a auditar
CA -> BC : 3. Consulta blockchain
BC --> CA : datos on-chain

CA -> ET : 4. Recupera datos on-chain
ET -> DB : consulta registro local
DB --> ET : datos locales
ET --> CA : retorna datos de transaccion

CA -> CA : 5. Verifica integridad con BD
note right : Control compara hash y metadatos entre blockchain y base de datos

CA --> PA : 6. Retorna resultado de auditoria
PA --> Actor : 7. Muestra resultado de auditoria

@enduml

